          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S004",
          "text": "我要报警。",
          "meaning_my": "ရဲတိုင်ချင်ပါတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_addition_08.03.01_N02",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S005",
          "text": "这里很危险！",
          "meaning_my": "ဒီနေရာ အန္တရာယ်ရှိတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B007",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S006",
          "text": "这里有人打架！",
          "meaning_my": "ဒီမှာ လူတွေ ရန်ဖြစ်နေကြတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B005",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S007",
          "text": "有人偷东西！",
          "meaning_my": "ပစ္စည်းခိုးနေတဲ့သူ ရှိတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B002",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S008",
          "text": "我的包被抢了。",
          "meaning_my": "အိတ် လုယူခံလိုက်ရတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B004",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S009",
          "text": "我的手机被偷了。",
          "meaning_my": "ဖုန်း ခိုးခံလိုက်ရတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B011",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S010",
          "text": "我的护照被偷了！",
          "meaning_my": "ပတ်စ်ပို့ ခိုးခံလိုက်ရတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B014",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S011",
          "text": "我的钱包丢了。",
          "meaning_my": "ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် ပျောက်သွားတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_addition_08.03.01_N03",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S012",
          "text": "我的证件丢了。",
          "meaning_my": "အထောက်အထားစာရွက်စာတမ်း ပျောက်သွားတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_addition_08.03.01_N04",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S013",
          "text": "有人跟踪我。",
          "meaning_my": "တစ်ယောက်ယောက် နောက်က လိုက်နေတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_addition_08.03.01_N06",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S014",
          "text": "有人威胁我！",
          "meaning_my": "တစ်ယောက်ယောက်က ခြိမ်းခြောက်နေတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B015",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S015",
          "text": "我在商场门口。",
          "meaning_my": "ဈေးဝယ်စင်တာ အဝင်ပေါက်မှာ ရှိနေတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B008",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S016",
          "text": "我不知道这里的地址。",
          "meaning_my": "ဒီနေရာရဲ့ လိပ်စာကို မသိဘူး။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
          "source_ref": "user_original_08.03.01_B017",
          "priority": "core",
          "pinyin": null,
          "phonetic_my": null,
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S017",
          "text": "那个人还在附近。",
          "meaning_my": "အဲဒီလူ ဒီနားမှာ ရှိနေသေးတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
