          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "08.03.01-S022",
          "text": "警察什么时候到？",
          "meaning_my": "ရဲတွေ ဘယ်တော့ ရောက်မလဲ။",
          "replies": [],
